# ===================================================================
# Notes API Playground (.http / REST Client)
# ===================================================================
# Berkas ini digunakan untuk melakukan pengujian REST API secara langsung
# melalui VS Code (REST Client extension), JetBrains Rider, atau Visual Studio.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@username = admin
@password = admin123

### 1. Health Check
# Mengecek status kesehatan aplikasi
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Get Paged Notes (Default: Page 1, Size 10)
# Mengambil daftar catatan berhalaman (memuat sub-object 'paging')
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notes?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

### 3. Create Note (POST)
# Membuat catatan baru dan menyimpan hasilnya di variabel response
# @name createNote
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notes
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Belajar ASP.NET Core & C#",
  "content": "Memahami Clean Architecture, EF Core 10, dan Standardized Response Envelope."
}

### 4. Get Note By ID
# Mengambil catatan berdasarkan ID yang baru saja dibuat
@noteId = {{createNote.response.body.data.id}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notes/{{noteId}}
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

### 5. Update Note (PUT)
# Mengubah title dan content dari catatan
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notes/{{noteId}}
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Belajar ASP.NET Core & C# (Updated)",
  "content": "Sudah memahami Controller, Middleware, EF Core, Unit Testing, dan Pagination!"
}

### 6. Delete Note (DELETE)
# Menghapus catatan berdasarkan ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notes/{{noteId}}
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

### 7. Test Tanpa Autentikasi (Expect 401 Unauthorized)
# Pengujian tanpa menyertakan header Authorization
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notes

### 8. Test Validasi Request (Expect Standardized 400 ErrorResponse)
# Judul diisi string kosong untuk menguji validasi data
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notes
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "content": "Konten valid tetapi judul kosong"
}

### 9. Test Data Tidak Ditemukan (Expect Standardized 404 ErrorResponse dengan errorCode NOTE_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

### 10. Get Analytics (Raw SQL Query & Aggregations)
# Mengambil ringkasan analitik catatan (total notes, kata rata-rata, statistik bulanan)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notes/analytics
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

